  <item>
    <title>女性祖传的应激障碍</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66a9d48f33ddcbb53c516240</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66a9d48f33ddcbb53c516240</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 31 Jul 2024 10:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目申申与小徐将结合自身的经历，与大家一起聊聊潜伏在女性身体里的障碍。</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢大家的收听、评论和订阅，如果想要加入听友群，可以搜索并关注微信公众号【万物FM】，扫描二维码小助手邀请你进群，记得备注“她的脉播”哦</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>进食障碍：那只是食物，不是爱</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="130">2:10</a> 进食障碍只是因为减肥吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="200">3:20</a> 被凝视的大胃女孩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="380">6:20</a> 被“自控”PUA的女孩们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="590">9:50</a> 暴食是唯一获得快乐的方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="700">11:40</a> 父母们为什么总在饭桌上训斥孩子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="920">15:20</a> 进食障碍的危险性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1095">18:15</a> 女性痛苦与脆弱无关</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1320">22:00</a> 过度减肥带来的“残疾”</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>疼痛障碍：会哭的孩子没有糖吃</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1540">25:40</a> 忍痛与自尊的联系 拒绝吃止痛药的女性们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">30:00</a> 女性使用的药有货不对版的风险</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2070">34:30</a> 男人垄断了上层资源 也垄断了医疗资源</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2280">38:00</a> 女人都是爱喊痛的牢骚鬼</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>性障碍：提起性，女人的心里总有恐惧</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2570">42:50</a> 痛的才是快乐的吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2820">47:00</a> 第一次使用卫生棉条的体验：我和自己的身体是最熟悉的陌生人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3060">51:00</a> 被威胁后 我失去了对身体的控制权</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3300">55:00</a> 女人三十猛如虎的真相</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>书籍推荐</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqWYrhTI_SDGS1drIcGrUsc0OMnx.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvvbPMOgi3Wtwm8fXK57Nr82SnOz.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lkJTPH7g-rd-_Ac3rgz-Ywly0LzC.m4a" length="114233497" type="audio/mp4"/>
