  <item>
    <title>信箱｜女性主义让我们站在一起</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65e801798d5665c008a405b3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65e801798d5665c008a405b3</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 06 Mar 2024 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目小徐和申申收集了五位听友的投稿，有思维上的迷惑也有现实中的困境，或许你也和这些投稿的朋友有着相同的疑惑，欢迎大家收听！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>投稿一：🌟爱分离</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">1:00</a> 我们该如何理解“🌟、爱分离”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">3:00</a> 爱和🌟对东亚人意味着什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="280">4:40</a> 当一个人女人如果没有爱的情况下，能否享受身体自由</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">6:00</a> 女人“🌟自由”的成本非常高昂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="450">7:30</a> 男人在🌟爱分离里的表现</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="630">10:30</a> 希望大家都能去探索自己的🌟需求</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>投稿二：是上学费高但保证能考上的民办大学还是上学费少点但不一定能考上的公办大学？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a> 请稿主和如果有想资助稿主的听友请联系我们</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>投稿三：善意的性别歧视</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1110">18:30</a> 男人更适合为女人发声是什么意思？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1370">22:50</a> 男性帮助女性的正确姿势：请对着男人喊而不是对着女人喊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1555">25:55</a> 绅士文化里隐藏的善意性别歧视</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">30:00</a> 想帮助他人的前提是多听多看多理解</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>投稿四：追星女的男宝妈心态</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2000">33:20</a> 说“女爱豆压抑” 她们到底在压抑什么呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2240">37:20</a> 爱豆圈里被追捧的少爷和被歧视的公主</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a> 比起被骂歌写的烂，女性制作人要先承受女人怎么能写歌的质疑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2620">43:40</a> 追星要避免“道心不坚”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2820">47:00</a> 冲破厌女思维道阻且长，但恭喜你已经迈出了第一步</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>投稿五：我要选择女性学专业吗？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3110">51:50</a> 如果想学女性学专业建议出国留学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3200">53:20</a> 人生虽然是旷野，但我们也需要在旷野上吃喝拉撒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3260">54:20</a> 女性主义的学习需要知识和生命经验相结合</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lk0w8-dOhg6iixHL6xqupy_yH15e.m4a" length="58055128" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:59:46</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Flve8K7sD2y09jUz4HZeitVPuWZZ.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
