  <item>
    <title>复工闲聊：五千年的糟粕都浓缩在这一周了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65d5914c513a776b57833926</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65d5914c513a776b57833926</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 21 Feb 2024 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>一句话简介：亲戚长辈大杂烩 我们女人又受罪</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间戳</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>和女人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">1:00</a> 小徐：女性长辈们通过节目理解了我</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="220">3:40</a> 申申：和表哥发生争吵后 母亲背叛了我</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">7:00</a> 一个女人怎么可以挑战男性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="840">14:00</a>男性的幽灵围绕在女性身边</span></p><span></span><p><span>和男人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="915">15:15</a> 原来传统就是不许女人上桌吃饭喝酒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a> 爸爸们在饭桌上想要的脸上有面让人一言难尽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1510">25:10</a> 和女人聊女权的男人们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1770">29:30</a> 被女人养大又被父权教化的男人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2440">40:40</a> 先男女后关系：父权偷走了女人的儿子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2710">45:10</a> 把女人塑造成疯子的男人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2940">49:00</a> 男人看到有力量的女性会混乱</span></p><span></span><p><span>和朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3000">50:00</a> 小徐和申申去看了热辣滚烫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3060">51:00</a> 我们小讲一下热辣滚烫，之后会专门做一期！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/liHZ1XWiD_uSkGGdkq5r2rsXt_gY.m4a" length="54383151" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:55:59</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Flve8K7sD2y09jUz4HZeitVPuWZZ.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
