    <guid isPermaLink="false">65c0850edde969cfdc59ab12</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 07 Feb 2024 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>一句话简介：本期节目是夸夸局</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目片尾有“作业！”感兴趣的小伙伴，可以参与哦</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢大家的收听、评论和订阅，如果想要加入听友群，可以搜索并关注微信公众号【万物FM】，扫描二维码小助手邀请你进群，记得备注“她的脉播”哦</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>女人的春节吐槽局</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">1:00</a>春节的饭桌，女性的战场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="750">12:30</a> 要给小姑子做排骨的妈妈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="880">14:40</a> 妈妈独自过年这件事发生了25次</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>从春节中，发现女性的领导力</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1250">20:50</a> 从买菜看女性的前置准备和需求调研</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1455">24:15</a> 从家务劳动看女性的规划协作能力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2015">33:35</a> 从照顾他人看女性的观察力和同理心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2570">42:50</a> 这个春节让我们一起夸夸妈妈们！</span></p>]]></description>
